{
  "id": "R9-cover-offline",
  "about": "design §6.4 R9 / R10: an offline page (list10) playing, the online ugc pushed over it (it opens and takes the player; an offline page on top cannot be used: in a debug build its open runs inside its initState and fails on the page below's Obx, see the part 3b report): the page under read while covered (R10a: the stand-in with the picture taken at the push, not the player: more.slots), the hooks; back (reopened, the hooks its own again) and the play callback called (R9b: the page on top cleared it at its pop, didPopNext registers this page's again: answeredBy main); then a blank page (no watch page) pushed and popped: playback goes on (推一个不夺播放器的页面, record: the 6 s file, so the state right after the pop)",
